        "table_body": "<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th colspan=\"9\"><p>受控表号：KQR-7.5.1-03-37/A0<br><img src=\"images/53ef5612b04b39a965b8d3d7593ff6fe35d2af66270715009a051e3cfc7d145d.jpg\"/><br><img src=\"images/53ef5612b04b39a965b8d3d7593ff6fe35d2af66270715009a051e3cfc7d145d.jpg\"/><br><img src=\"images/53ef5612b04b39a965b8d3d7593ff6fe35d2af66270715009a051e3cfc7d145d.jpg\"/></p></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td colspan=\"9\"><p>PT9L操作作业指导书（标准）</p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td colspan=\"9\"><p>编号：WI-PT9L-AL02</p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p>Type</p></td>\n    <td><p>Page</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"2\"><p>Progress Name</p></td>\n    <td><p>Ver.No.</p></td>\n    <td><p>Date</p></td>\n    <td><p>Prepared</p></td>\n    <td><p>Checked</p></td>\n    <td><p>Approved</p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p>部件名称</p></td>\n    <td><p>页码</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"2\"><p>工序名称</p></td>\n    <td><p>版本</p></td>\n    <td><p>生效期</p></td>\n    <td><p>准备</p></td>\n    <td><p>审核</p></td>\n    <td><p>批准</p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p>邦定\n机芯</p></td>\n    <td><p>1/1</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"2\"><p>分板下盘</p></td>\n    <td><p>1</p></td>\n    <td><p>2024.06.20</p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p>物料名称</p></td>\n    <td><p>工序      描述</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"3\"><p>图象</p></td>\n    <td><p>操作</p></td>\n    <td><p>设备工具名称</p></td>\n    <td><p>人员装备要求</p></td>\n    <td><p>要求</p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td rowspan=\"41\"><p>基板</p></td>\n    <td rowspan=\"32\"><p>裂片\n（示意图）</p></td>\n    <td rowspan=\"32\" colspan=\"3\"><p><img src=\"images/6579e52143c3093db6407c71fa43f84b1699e222a2f68a0281b84cb9b73ed26d.png\"/></p></td>\n    <td rowspan=\"32\"><p>1、核对基板规格型号；\n\n2、左手握紧基板边缘，右手使用偏口钳沿基板边缘有效孔将基板板边依次分开（无基板板边的可不分）；\n\n3、双手握紧拆分板边后的基板将基板拆分至单块；\n</p></td>\n    <td rowspan=\"32\"><p>偏口钳子\n编号：XXXXI-02QXXX或XXXXI-01XXXX \nPCB分板工装\n编号：S0HHXXXXXX</p></td>\n    <td rowspan=\"41\"><p>佩戴防静电手套或静电手腕带</p></td>\n    <td rowspan=\"32\"><p>要求：\n\n1、使用偏口钳拆分基板板边时，不要碰到基板上的元器件；\n\n2、双手拆分基板时，均匀用力不要按压在基板元器件上；\n\n3、PCB边缘不可有毛刺；\n\n风险：分板不良；</p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td rowspan=\"9\"><p>装盘\n（示意图）</p></td>\n    <td rowspan=\"9\" colspan=\"3\"><p></p></td>\n    <td rowspan=\"9\"><p>按图4所示将拆分后的基板依次摆放在铝盘内。</p></td>\n    <td rowspan=\"9\"><p></p></td>\n    <td rowspan=\"9\"><p>要求：\n1、基板的放置方向正确、无误。\n\n2、拆分后的基板边缘不得有多余角料、毛刺。\n风险：分板不良；</p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n</table>",
